etc. &amp;nbsp;The destination wedding coordinator suggested just sending out a nice email with information announcing our wedding. &amp;nbsp;Have any of you done that? &amp;nbsp;If so, what was the response? &amp;nbsp;I also had someone recommend doing an e-card for the save the date and regular invitations later. &amp;nbsp;I would love to hear what you did an anything you would&#039;ve done differently. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877504,"PostDate":1414844249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am wondering what others have done in terms of save the dates, invitations etc. \u00a0The destination wedding coordinator suggested just sending out a nice email with information announcing our wedding. \u00a0Have any of you done that? \u00a0If so, what was the response? \u00a0I also had someone recommend doing an e-card for the save the date and regular invitations later. \u00a0I would love to hear what you did an anything you would've done differently. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nateerinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412195489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280198.jpg?_r=1412219510","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eirbear0915","Id":280198,"Name":"eirbear0915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2292fb017c008ab495b7718a4d199621","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I only sent an invitation. &amp;nbsp; We sent out our invites mid May for our January wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also made a website on www.mywedding.com and our invite directed our guests there to get all the resort info, prices, travel agent contact info, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Worked well for us as we didn&#039;t have much time for STDs and invites.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have heard of people do e-card STDs and I think that is also a great idea - it would also save on $$$.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You will find each person does something a little different. &amp;nbsp; If we had more time I may have done a STD first, but our guests only had 90 days to put down a deposit so we just sent out the invites to make it easy for everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877506,"PostDate":1414845265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I only sent an invitation. \u00a0 We sent out our invites mid May for our January wedding.<\/p>\n<p>I also made a website on www.mywedding.com and our invite directed our guests there to get all the resort info, prices, travel agent contact info, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Worked well for us as we didn't have much time for STDs and invites.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have heard of people do e-card STDs and I think that is also a great idea - it would also save on $$$.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You will find each person does something a little different. \u00a0 If we had more time I may have done a STD first, but our guests only had 90 days to put down a deposit so we just sent out the invites to make it easy for everyone.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399407002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72bdc69c2899dd4d7a1463a73631bf98","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I sent out Save the dates around June\/July of 2014 for my May 2015 wedding. I am working on finishing my invites now. I also have a wedding website with a ton of information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This link below is to a different thread I posted that has my STD pictures and invitation pictures so far.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78310-my-diy-wedding-invitations-stds\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78310-my-diy-wedding-invitations-stds\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;^ That is my wedding website&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877526,"PostDate":1414872173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I sent out Save the dates around June\/July of 2014 for my May 2015 wedding. I am working on finishing my invites now. I also have a wedding website with a ton of information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This link below is to a different thread I posted that has my STD pictures and invitation pictures so far.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78310-my-diy-wedding-invitations-stds\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...vitations-stds\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/rcstromberg.w...scelestewedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>^ That is my wedding website<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410901988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69e45ff7b517c47394fc73402b2002ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We just sent out STDs out this week and we are not getting married till Nov 20 next year. I decided to send mine now because our deposit deadline is in Feb and with Christmas coming up I wanted to give people plenty of notice. We plan to send out our invited in June giving people a reminder at &amp;nbsp;about 6 months until the wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Like others I have a website that I have told people to check often because we will be updating it as much as we can.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877534,"PostDate":1414914898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We just sent out STDs out this week and we are not getting married till Nov 20 next year. I decided to send mine now because our deposit deadline is in Feb and with Christmas coming up I wanted to give people plenty of notice. We plan to send out our invited in June giving people a reminder at \u00a0about 6 months until the wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Like others I have a website that I have told people to check often because we will be updating it as much as we can.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.tipler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404852144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278914.jpg?_r=1427504777","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissJen3","Id":278914,"Name":"MissJen3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.148.35.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18f3d2168076f25f053cac110bb887a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We sent out STD&#039;s....in September...which is the month we are getting married in next year...I went on Zazzle and created some from a stock design they had which ended up costing about $73.00 bucks. If I would have thought about it more...I could have done some myself that would have been more cost effective. I was more concerned with getting the info out to guest so that they could start planning. The hurricane hit in Cabo...and really put a hold on things so now I&#039;ve had more time to think things through as far as invitations and other things. I am also creating a website...but just wanted to get the STD&#039;s out for those who aren&#039;t tech savvy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877537,"PostDate":1414919235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We sent out STD's....in September...which is the month we are getting married in next year...I went on Zazzle and created some from a stock design they had which ended up costing about $73.00 bucks. If I would have thought about it more...I could have done some myself that would have been more cost effective. I was more concerned with getting the info out to guest so that they could start planning. The hurricane hit in Cabo...and really put a hold on things so now I've had more time to think things through as far as invitations and other things. I am also creating a website...but just wanted to get the STD's out for those who aren't tech savvy.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10704;484\/st\/20150911\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/0c51\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"soulgroovy75@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.148.35.209","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400338658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277999.jpg?_r=1400719404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soulgroovy","Id":277999,"Name":"soulgroovy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a4dc014ebd7559e9110ebb1c8ffe273","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cfinkenbine\"] Thank you for the links. &amp;nbsp;This is very helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am thinking about sending out an e-card save the date since I have a lot of information from our destination wedding agent. &amp;nbsp;But I really appreciate everyone&#039;s insight. &amp;nbsp; I will most likely send out save the dates within the next week or so. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877543,"PostDate":1414925143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279867\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279867-cfinkenbine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cfinkenbine<\/span><\/a> Thank you for the links. \u00a0This is very helpful!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am thinking about sending out an e-card save the date since I have a lot of information from our destination wedding agent. \u00a0But I really appreciate everyone's insight. \u00a0 I will most likely send out save the dates within the next week or so. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nateerinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412195489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280198.jpg?_r=1412219510","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eirbear0915","Id":280198,"Name":"eirbear0915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"654c49566a7d2846dca6dd126e2f422e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I created a website that had the TA-created save the date along with other information, and then attached that in an e-card STD. We sent the invites out about a week later - I had wanted to just send out the regular invites (and no e-card STD) but since we also only had 90 days for people to put in their deposits I wanted to make sure people had as much time as possible to look over the information. This seemed to work well and I&#039;m glad we didn&#039;t send out multiple paper documents since the postage would have added up quickly!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877546,"PostDate":1414929420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I created a website that had the TA-created save the date along with other information, and then attached that in an e-card STD. We sent the invites out about a week later - I had wanted to just send out the regular invites (and no e-card STD) but since we also only had 90 days for people to put in their deposits I wanted to make sure people had as much time as possible to look over the information. This seemed to work well and I'm glad we didn't send out multiple paper documents since the postage would have added up quickly!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katymareneck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395230695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KatyM81","Id":277234,"Name":"KatyM81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.9.78.17","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf93a0007db60ea8af8fb35098eb4919","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For our STDs, I did emails (notifying about travel information for those who wanted to book ahead of time) STDs through &lt;a&gt;https:\/\/www.paperlesspost.com&amp;nbsp;and&lt;\/a&gt;then sent out a card STD through Vistaprint.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877548,"PostDate":1414930105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For our STDs, I did emails (notifying about travel information for those who wanted to book ahead of time) STDs through <a>https:\/\/www.paperlesspost.com\u00a0and<\/a>then sent out a card STD through Vistaprint.\u00a0 <\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411639462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f150898886d40d199a59180ee945edde","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KatyM81\"] I think that is the direction I am leaning towards. &amp;nbsp;We are still waiting on the final contract but I want to make sure I am ready to go once it&#039;s finalized.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877550,"PostDate":1414931002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277234\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277234-katym81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatyM81<\/span><\/a> I think that is the direction I am leaning towards. \u00a0We are still waiting on the final contract but I want to make sure I am ready to go once it's finalized.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nateerinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412195489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280198.jpg?_r=1412219510","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eirbear0915","Id":280198,"Name":"eirbear0915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7a1b08536a12b08b1587e998ae58cb0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"eirbear0915\" post=\"1877550\" timestamp=\"1414952602\"]\n@[member=\"KatyM81\"] I think that is the direction I am leaning towards.  We are still waiting on the final contract but I want to make sure I am ready to go once it&#039;s finalized.[\/quote]I think if you start working on your website now (if you&#039;re doing one) and have it all ready to go with the info to just plug in that will help you save some sanity once you get the contract finalized. We had the e-card mirror our invites and it pretty much just had the date and pointed people to the website. I think we accidentally missed a few people on the email but since they ended up getting the invite a week later I didn&#039;t feel too terrible about it :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1877552,"PostDate":1414933039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>eirbear0915, on 02 November 2014 - 12:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277234\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277234-katym81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatyM81<\/span><\/a> I think that is the direction I am leaning towards. \u00a0We are still waiting on the final contract but I want to make sure I am ready to go once it's finalized.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I think if you start working on your website now (if you're doing one) and have it all ready to go with the info to just plug in that will help you save some sanity once you get the contract finalized. We had the e-card mirror our invites and it pretty much just had the date and pointed people to the website. I think we accidentally missed a few people on the email but since they ended up getting the invite a week later I didn't feel too terrible about it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katymareneck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395230695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KatyM81","Id":277234,"Name":"KatyM81","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78326","Title":"Save The Date, Invitations Etc. - What Did You Do?","LastPostDate":1417960439},"Pages":{"TotalItems":25,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
