{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c55829b0df04382f8fcdc32aa1f945a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KatyM81\"] Funny you mention the website. &amp;nbsp;I just set up our website this morning. &amp;nbsp;I think it will be one of the easiest ways for everyone to get all the information and if there are any changes they can go there. &amp;nbsp;Thank you again for your post. &amp;nbsp;It has been very helpful!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877559,"PostDate":1414935899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277234\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277234-katym81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatyM81<\/span><\/a> Funny you mention the website. \u00a0I just set up our website this morning. \u00a0I think it will be one of the easiest ways for everyone to get all the information and if there are any changes they can go there. \u00a0Thank you again for your post. \u00a0It has been very helpful!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nateerinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412195489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280198.jpg?_r=1412219510","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eirbear0915","Id":280198,"Name":"eirbear0915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41998f810ba944efcc60a3730f2bcc62","RawContent":"[quote name=\"eirbear0915\" post=\"1877559\" timestamp=\"1414957499\"]\n@[member=\"KatyM81\"] Funny you mention the website.  I just set up our website this morning.  I think it will be one of the easiest ways for everyone to get all the information and if there are any changes they can go there.  Thank you again for your post.  It has been very helpful!  :)[\/quote]No problem! Good luck with everything!","Attachments":[],"Id":1877560,"PostDate":1414936061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>eirbear0915, on 02 November 2014 - 01:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277234\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277234-katym81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatyM81<\/span><\/a> Funny you mention the website. \u00a0I just set up our website this morning. \u00a0I think it will be one of the easiest ways for everyone to get all the information and if there are any changes they can go there. \u00a0Thank you again for your post. \u00a0It has been very helpful!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>No problem! Good luck with everything!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katymareneck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395230695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KatyM81","Id":277234,"Name":"KatyM81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.9.40.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b580f2cfa6bb02fbafd8efdd4f6f6dc8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We actually made a Facebook page, website and sent save-the-dates.&amp;nbsp; Just finished our invites\/rsvp we will send soon.&amp;nbsp; I think I only spent about $50 total for all.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nWe made our save-the-dates on Vista Print.&amp;nbsp;I think we got a promo code and only paid around $5 for it.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nOur Invitations and RSVP cards I made my self.&amp;nbsp; I found a template for $10. (there are some out there&amp;nbsp;for free too).   Just purchased all my cutting, scorring tools with 40-50% off coupons from Michaels.&amp;nbsp; Purchased the paper\/envelopes with coupons from paper company on line for about $30.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nSave-the-dates: Postcards\n\nOur invitatons:&amp;nbsp; Passports\n\nRSVP: Boarding Pass Tickets.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877869,"PostDate":1415281359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We actually made a Facebook page, website and sent save-the-dates.\u00a0 Just finished our invites\/rsvp we will send soon.\u00a0 I think I only spent about $50 total for all.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe made our save-the-dates on Vista Print.\u00a0I think we got a promo code and only paid around $5 for it.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nOur Invitations and RSVP cards I made my self.\u00a0 I found a template for $10. (there are some out there\u00a0for free too).\u00a0\u00a0 Just purchased all my cutting, scorring tools with 40-50% off coupons from Michaels.\u00a0 Purchased the paper\/envelopes with coupons from paper company on line for about $30.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSave-the-dates: Postcards<br>\nOur invitatons:\u00a0 Passports<br>\nRSVP: Boarding Pass Tickets.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383031667,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dc11ffae1eed431acf43b8ded73cc3e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We did something really fun for our save the dates!&amp;nbsp; We had an engagement party over the summer and invited all our family and friends.&amp;nbsp; We had about 80 people.&amp;nbsp; We knew that many people who not be able to attend the destination wedding, but it was a fun way to get everyone excited.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We hired a photobooth and designed the photo to have &#039;save the date\" printed at the bottom.&amp;nbsp; All guests left with their fun and crazy photos which also doubled as a save the date.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877871,"PostDate":1415282137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We did something really fun for our save the dates!\u00a0 We had an engagement party over the summer and invited all our family and friends.\u00a0 We had about 80 people.\u00a0 We knew that many people who not be able to attend the destination wedding, but it was a fun way to get everyone excited.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We hired a photobooth and designed the photo to have 'save the date\" printed at the bottom.\u00a0 All guests left with their fun and crazy photos which also doubled as a save the date.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396961252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f52d9ab8de341f5179274bd8777098a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"misbosox\"] Wow you were able to get everything finished for very little. &amp;nbsp;We just finalized our date, so I think I might do an e-card save the date and paper invitations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalero\"] what a great idea. &amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t think we have time for that, but if we did that would be so fun.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877901,"PostDate":1415308944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a> Wow you were able to get everything finished for very little. \u00a0We just finalized our date, so I think I might do an e-card save the date and paper invitations.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@veryvalero what a great idea. \u00a0I don't think we have time for that, but if we did that would be so fun.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nateerinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.62.134.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412195489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280198.jpg?_r=1412219510","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eirbear0915","Id":280198,"Name":"eirbear0915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.2.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"453a1c8a1cf624bfc557287cdd338f0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am only going to be sending out my invitations about a year in advance and then make sure i have everyones email so i can send them updates if needed- also they will have the website details so they can know everything about the location and booking info. I am also going to save money by making them rsvp online. everyone has access to a computer and this will save money in the end.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879066,"PostDate":1416839284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am only going to be sending out my invitations about a year in advance and then make sure i have everyones email so i can send them updates if needed- also they will have the website details so they can know everything about the location and booking info. I am also going to save money by making them rsvp online. everyone has access to a computer and this will save money in the end.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"skushliak@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.2.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416837081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sophia7420","Id":281240,"Name":"sophia7420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.169.253.92","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"266a65047a5190de7f34c60c09e8e016","RawContent":"@[member=\"soulgroovy\"] where can you create your own stamps for less. I saw that you created them on zazzle.com. How many did you do? Also you mention you could have created them on your own somewhere. Where could I find that?","Attachments":[],"Id":1879076,"PostDate":1416852793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277999\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277999-soulgroovy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">soulgroovy<\/span><\/a> where can you create your own stamps for less. I saw that you created them on zazzle.com. How many did you do? Also you mention you could have created them on your own somewhere. Where could I find that?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carrieandsamswedding15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.169.253.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412813196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280407.jpg?_r=1425426307","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"carrieandsam","Id":280407,"Name":"carrieandsam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4b1a8f0c0d1075bd6fe71be0b46e0f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My travel agent included customized save the date postcards, so those just cost us a stamp. The card had our wedding website on it for those who wanted more info immediately. We probably would&#039;ve done an email STD had they not been free.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879456,"PostDate":1417516752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My travel agent included customized save the date postcards, so those just cost us a stamp. The card had our wedding website on it for those who wanted more info immediately. We probably would've done an email STD had they not been free.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403525789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bec586e3c0c8c8d84631d641a9ae0a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We sent out electronic Save the Dates in August 2014 for our June 2015 wedding. So far, we only have 3 couples who have put down a deposit (it is only $150!) and none of them are even our family. I&#039;m planning to send out a reminder email this week before people get too crazy with the holidays to see if I can get more people to book. I&#039;ve heard stories of our resort selling out or overbooking\/bumping so I really worry if people wait too long they won&#039;t be able to stay with us! That kind of defeats the purpose.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m trying to avoid sending a mailed invite entirely - since I don&#039;t have people&#039;s addresses and they all have all the information already anyway! Oh and to save money.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879457,"PostDate":1417517961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We sent out electronic Save the Dates in August 2014 for our June 2015 wedding. So far, we only have 3 couples who have put down a deposit (it is only $150!) and none of them are even our family. I'm planning to send out a reminder email this week before people get too crazy with the holidays to see if I can get more people to book. I've heard stories of our resort selling out or overbooking\/bumping so I really worry if people wait too long they won't be able to stay with us! That kind of defeats the purpose.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm trying to avoid sending a mailed invite entirely - since I don't have people's addresses and they all have all the information already anyway! Oh and to save money.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403094487,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78326,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f5a7b24487cd759659be6d170e8387b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We sent out magnets with our date and website on them in April\/May 2014 for our May 2015 wedding, but people didn&#039;t even clue in that there was a website on them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got our invites this past Friday and they will be going out by the end of this week. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879462,"PostDate":1417520734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We sent out magnets with our date and website on them in April\/May 2014 for our May 2015 wedding, but people didn't even clue in that there was a website on them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got our invites this past Friday and they will be going out by the end of this week. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412109298,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":25,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
